  "articleBody": "A kitchen peninsula can add prep space, storage, seating, and a clearer division between cooking and living areas, but successful installation depends on measured clearances, cabinet support, countertop overhang, utilities, and the existing floor plan. A design-build contractor can assess these conditions before finalizing layout, materials, permits, and construction details.",
